## Mixed

| Name | Description |
| ------ | ------ |
| [GroupedClass](classes/GroupedClass.md) | A class sharing a group with a function, so the index table headers a mixed group with "Name" rather than with the single kind it holds. |
| [groupedFunction](functions/groupedFunction.md) | A function sharing a group with a class. Its single `@example` block is left unmerged, so the heading comes from TypeDoc's `tag_example` rather than the plugin's `tag_examples`. |
